    <section id="with-non-image-elements">
      <title>With non-image elements</title>
      <p>Place additional DITA elements within a <xmlelement
        >grid-row</xmlelement> element to add them within a carousel.
        Additional structure and spacing can be added by using the <xmlelement>grid-col</xmlelement> element.</p>
    </section>
<fig>
      <title>With non-image elements</title>
      <image href="src/carousel/non-image-elements.png" scalefit="yes"/>
