    <section id="multiple-slides-with-titles">
      <title>Multiple slides with titles</title>
      <p>Add multiple <xmlelement>image</xmlelement> elements within each <xmlelement
        >carousel-item</xmlelement> and include a
          <xmlelement>grid-row</xmlelement> element for title texts.</p>
    </section>
<fig>
      <title>Multiple slides with titles</title>
      <image href="src/carousel/slides-with-titles.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>
    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
